    <a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="header-mark"></a>简介</h2><p><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/k8s/">k8s</a> 的组件学习记录</p>
<p>主要组件如下:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/k8s%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/#%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8">容器技术</a></li>
<li>Api-server: 提供 api 接口作为主要入口</li>
<li>Etcd: 存储配置和状态信息</li>
<li>Controller Manager: 控制器, 管理 Replication,Deployment 等等</li>
<li>Scheduler: 调度分发应用程序</li>
<li>kubelet: 管理容器的启动和停止, 健康状态</li>
<li>kube-proxy: 每个节点上的代理,转发的实现</li>
<li>CoreDNS: 内部的 dns 解析</li>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/k8s%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6%E5%89%96%E6%9E%90/#%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E7%BB%84%E4%BB%B6">网络组件</a>: 联通节点, 容器网络</li>
<li>Ingress Controller: 提供对外的入口. 承接 Http, https 流量</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="容器" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%ae%b9%e5%99%a8" class="header-mark"></a>容器</h2><ul>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/k8s/">k8s</a> 通过 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/CRI/">CRI</a> 规范来进行实际的编排操作.</li>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/docker/">docker</a> 操作 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/Containerd/">Containerd</a></li>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/Containerd/">Containerd</a> 操作符合 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/OCI/">OCI</a> 标准的容器运行时. 采用 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/runc/">runc</a> 为默认容器运行时.</li>
</ul>
<p><img src="/posts/%E9%99%84%E4%BB%B6/%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E7%94%9F%E6%80%81%E5%9B%BE1.png"></p>]]></description></item><item><title>k8s</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/k8s/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/k8s/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><code>k8s</code> 是非常流行的容器编排工具.</p>
<p>要点:</p>
<ul>
<li>免费</li>
<li>社区,生态强大</li>
<li>事实标准</li>
</ul>]]></description></item></channel></rss>